 "description": "The decision guide: where to start by the shape of the task, the pattern to consider next and when to avoid each, plus the pattern families (the `choosing` rows of /patterns/index.md, without the rest of that page). With a family, /patterns/index.md?family={family}: that family\u2019s patterns and the rows that name them. With a domain, /domains/{domain}.md: the task shapes common in that kind of work, their rows, the sources of the published findings tagged with it (never a ranking; each finding in words at /domains/{domain}/findings.md) and its starters. The response includes exact next calls for the listed patterns and starters.",
